; VGPU98 8x16 font, code page 437. Original design for this project.
; Used by 400-line text modes and modes 11h and 12h. Format: spec/font-format.md.
;
; Metrics (rows 0-15):
;   capitals and digits rows 3-11 (9 rows); ascenders start on row 2
;   lower case x-height rows 6-11 (6 rows); i and j dots on row 4
;   descenders rows 12-14
;   accents: lower case rows 3-4; capitals with accents shrink to rows 4-11
;   rows 0, 1 and 15 stay blank except in cell-spanning glyphs, so the 8x14
;   font can be derived from this one by dropping rows 0 and 15
; Strokes: vertical stems two pixels wide, horizontals one pixel. Letters use
; columns 0-6 and keep column 7 clear, so characters stay apart in 8-dot cells.
; Box drawing (B3h-DAh) follows the 'lines' positions below: single lines one
; pixel wide on row 7 and column 3, double lines on rows 6 and 8 and columns 2
; and 4.

font 8x16
lines 7 6 8 3 2 4

